    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ……？
ここって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh...? This is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;トーティス村&lt;White&gt;、
&lt;Cless&gt;さんたちが住んでる村だぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Red&gt;Totus Village&lt;White&gt;. You know, the
village where &lt;Cless&gt; lives?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前に来てたっけ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I...have I been here before...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ……それはオレらに
聞かれても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunno. Why're you
asking me, though?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;トーティス村&lt;White&gt;、
僕の生まれ育った村だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was born and
raised in &lt;Red&gt;Totus&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前に来たことって
あったっけ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did I come here, though...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスと戦った時に一度、
来てるかもしれないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You might've been here once or
twice when we were fighting Dhaos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、でもあれは、
ミゲールの町かもしれないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, but that probably would
have been the town of Miguel.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか前に来たような……
見覚えがあるんだよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Somehow, I recognize this... I
feel like I've been here before...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んじゃあ、やっぱ
来たことがあるんじゃね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, you must have come
at some point, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、来た覚えがないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I don't remember
coming here at all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……よくわからないです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't really get it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメンゴメン、
もしかしたら、小さい時に
来てるかもしれないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry, sorry! I'm just thinking, maybe
I came here when I was little?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えば、精霊の森って
この近くだっけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now that you mention it, isn't the
Forest of Spirits pretty close by?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;さん、精霊の森に
住んでたって言ってましたね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You said you lived in the
Forest of Spirits, right, &lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、その時に父さんに
連れてこられたのかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. Maybe Dad brought me
here with him back then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっきから心臓が
どきどきしてる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My heart started racing
when we got here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだろう、
この不安感……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why do I feel
so uneasy...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……どうしたんですか？
&lt;Rody&gt;さん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Are you okay, &lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ううん、この村って
のどかでいいところだなって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, yeah! This village is
really nice, huh? Peaceful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな村に住んでみるのも
悪くないかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It might be nice to live
in a village like this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きみには&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;が
あるでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But you already live
at &lt;Red&gt;My House&lt;White&gt;, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>given that Ethos is the speaker, it doesn't quite make grammatical sense to use Ethos's House, so I altered it while keeping the color tag for fun. -dragon.
lemme know what you think.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's true.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだ、&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;を
ここに持ってくりゃ
いいんじゃねーの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, what if we just pick up &lt;Red&gt;Ethos's
House&lt;White&gt; and carry it here with us?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むちゃくちゃ言わないで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't be silly, &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……確かに
いいところだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It is a really
nice place, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私にはあまり
いい思い出のないとこ
なのかもな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My memories of it might
not be so nice...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
